        "source_sha256": "7554c6f21698ad91ed0dc041bed71d28a7ea34854f969d68d9a5eb487c6f5af7",
        "text": "- Home\n- Values That Define Leadership\n- Priorities\n- Endorsements\n- Testimonials\n- Get to Know John\n- Got a Question for Coach, Ask here!\n- Join Team McBride\n- 9th Congressional District Map\n# Standing Strong For Truth and Freedom\n## JOHN \"COACH\" McBRIDE For people, for winning, and for the community he represents.\nDONATE\n## JOHN \"COACH\" McBRIDE\n#### A COACH FOR CHAMPIONS\n## Values That Define Leadership\n- All\n#### VALUES\nJohn McBride is a proud American who cherishes the freedoms and opportunities this great nation provides. Rooted in faith and driven by a calling, John believes it is his duty to preserve the precious gift of liberty for generations to come. His unwavering commitment to defending the Constitution and empowering “We the People” sets him apart as a leader who will fight for the rights of every citizen.\nLearn More\n#### COMMITMENT\nLiberty is not inheritedit must be protected, nurtured, and defended. John is dedicated to restoring power to the people, ensuring that no elite or outside force undermines the principles of democracy that our forefathers fought to establish.\nLearn More\n#### TRUTH\nJohn McBride upholds truth as the cornerstone of leadership. He believes in transparency, accountability, and serving with integrity. It’s not just a privilege but a duty to ensure that the vision of freedom and opportunity continues for future generations. By standing firm on what’s right and taking decisive action, John aims to restore trust in government and empower citizens with honesty and clarity.\nLearn More\n## Priorities\n#### John McBride’s campaign is built on actionable solutions that address pressing issues in California’s 9th District and beyond:\n- All\n#### Health Care\nRemove Dangerous Chemicals from our Food and Water -Medical Freedom -Greater Emphasis on Natural Healing Methods -No Death Boards\n#### Safer Communities\nCrime -Mental Health Initiatives -Support for Youth and Families -Support for Local Law Enforcement -Stronger Southern Border -Support Criminal Prosecution\n#### Agriculture\nAgriculture Abundance of Water (water rights) -Reduce Government Influence on Small, Private Farms\n#### Economy\nReduce Oppressive Tax Policies -Drastically Shrink Government Spending -Support for Small Business -No tax on Social Security -Energy Independence\n#### Youth\nEducation -Youth and Family Support -Mental Health Services Homelessness\n#### Liberty\nWe The People as Guardians of our Republic --No CBDC (central bank digital currency) -Voting Rights\n## Endorsements\n- Endoorsements\n#### California Republican Assembly (CRA)\n#### San Joaquin County Republican Party\n#### San Joaquin Young Republicans\n#### Central Valley Impact Republicans\n#### Contra Costa Republican Party\n#### Reform California\n## Testimonials\n- All\nI am writing in support of John McBride and his pursuit to run for Congress, whom I have personally known since 1989 as a freshman football player at the University of the Pacific. Under his watch, I gained the knowledge, work ethic, and body transformation that helped me tremendously in the transition to be drafted into the NFL and play professional football for seven years after college. Coach McBride has worn many hats and coached at multiple levels. He has obtained a high-level respect for his worth ethic and ability to work with people from many walks of life. He has positively impacted many young men and women, and his desire to do the same in the political arena should be commended.\nGreg Bishop\nSeven-year NFL player\nJohn McBride is a man of faith. Additionally, he has been a great trainer and mentor. I have also observed him to be a rock solid husband and father. He also stands on what he says and takes action on what he believes is right for others.\nMike Nunnelly\nFormer Professional Basketball Player\n“John McBride has made a profound impact in the lives of people in the greater San Joaquin area for decades, myself included. Many leaders have knowledge, but John McBride pairs his knowledge with wisdom from many life experiences. He has been a strong influence for myself and so many others over the years, and has played a part in fostering many productive members to society. John’s commitment to the younger generations in our area over the years displays his selflessness and consistency as a person. If you know John McBride, you know that he is running for Congress not for personal gain, but for the coming generations in our area, state, and country.”\n– Adam Gotelli\nProfessional Basketball Player\n“John McBride is a man of integral character. As an athlete that dreamed of playing Major League Baseball, John helped make that dream a reality. And more importantly, helped me develop Major League character in the process. John’s commitment to me as an athlete was matched, if not doubled, in his commitment to me as a person. He is a man dedicated to his family, faith and his work. He always taught, “To those much is given, much is expected”; and John not only would teach this to his athletes, but he would embody this. He has a code of excellence that he lives by, and also demands from the people that surround him. As an athlete that has had the privilege to train under John McBride and experience him on and off the field, I give my endorsement for John McBride for Congress!!”\n– Gio Brusa\nProfessional Baseball Player\nJohn will be running for Congress in California’s 9th Congressional District. California needs change. They need new leadership. John is an awesome candidate for this position. I am proud of his professionalism. May he do well in this new endeavor.\nRuth Palmer\nJohn, although it's great to finally see someone willing to wade through the swamp for all the right reasons, I'm not sure you are right for Congress. You have way too much integrity and honesty. Sorry, but I've lost my faith that our wonderful nation can in fact be fixed. But having known you since college, I'll put my faith in you being smart enough and tough enough to make a difference and NOT sell your soul. You'll get a donation from me!\nBob Moore\nJohn is running for Congress in CA! Get ready for a Warrior to run! He’s in Stockton. I “ran” from CA in desperation to escape. He is staying to fight the good fight! So proud!\nMarcia Anderson\nI wholeheartedly endorse John's candidacy as our representative in the U.S. House of Representatives!\nDr. Bill Henshaw\nYou are absolutely the voice for the People! All the best Big John!\nJohn Gawlak\n## Get to Know John\n- All\n#### Learn More about John\nMy name is John McBride and I am running for Congress in California’s 9th Congressional District. I will Stand Strong – for California, for America, for freedom, for the people. We don’t need politicians, we need principled leaders who will stand strong for us.\nLearn More\nDONATE\nAny amount, great or small, is an investment in helping America “Stand Strong Again”.\nHelp JOHN STAND STRONG FOR YOU\n## Got a Question for Coach, Ask here!\n- P.O. Box 692165 Stockton Ca, 95269\n## Join Team McBride\nCoach McBride can't do it alone. Whether you have an hour a week or more, your time and support can help make a lasting difference in District 9.\n## 9th Congressional District Map\n- Album\nOpt in for campaign updates!",
